    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Awkward physics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the slippery, bouncy movement of a potion bottle. Every jump demands perfect timing, angling, and speed control.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Death...everywhere</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no safe zones. Title screen? Game lobby? Even checkpoints? All of them are potential death traps. One bad landing, and you shatter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pick your poison</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use optional checkpoints to save progress, but at a cost. Choose wisely. Not every risk is worth it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Short but brutal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fewer levels, higher skill ceiling. It\u2019s a concentrated, punishing experience that\u2019s incredibly rewarding to overcome.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lore-accurate difficulty</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat the game on normal? Try \u201clore-accurate\u201d mode. It\u2019s the way it was meant to be played\u2026 and you probably won\u2019t survive.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Awkward physics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the slippery, bouncy movement of a potion bottle. Every jump demands perfect timing, angling, and speed control.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Death...everywhere</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no safe zones. Title screen? Game lobby? Even checkpoints? All of them are potential death traps. One bad landing, and you shatter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pick your poison</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use optional checkpoints to save progress, but at a cost. Choose wisely. Not every risk is worth it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Short but brutal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fewer levels, higher skill ceiling. It\u2019s a concentrated, punishing experience that\u2019s incredibly rewarding to overcome.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lore-accurate difficulty</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat the game on normal? Try \u201clore-accurate\u201d mode. It\u2019s the way it was meant to be played\u2026 and you probably won\u2019t survive.</p>",
    "short_description": "Break out of a dungeon as a fragile soul in a potion bottle. Roll, bounce, and avoid fall damage while fighting awkward physics to survive the impossible. Can you escape without breaking?",
